# What @lsp gives with every function of hooks.zig left `lsp.todo`: the
# outline, definition, references, highlights, hover and the names in
# scope, from the scopes, definitions and uses the grammar declares, and a
# warning at each name nothing defines (`undefined warning`).
initialize
open main.tally
symbols main.tally
# A use of a module, a function, a parameter and a local; a definition.
definition main.tally 4:13
